id: pm-gh1728
title: "GH-1728: complete-list recovery drops an explicit includeBody request, so a repaired whole-list read returns every item without bodies"
description: "GH-1728 (filed 2026-11-14, reproduced on the published 2026.11.14 tarball). A caller requests a complete list with bodies (createCompleteListOptions({ includeBody: true }) plus a page limit); certifyCompleteListResult correctly refuses the incomplete page with PmCompleteListValidationError, but the recovery it emits omits the body request. The CLI retry (pm list --all --output-include full --strict-read --no-truncate --output-budget unbounded --output-limit unbounded --json) returns 4/4 items and 0/4 bodies, and the SDK recipe client.listAllComplete() likewise drops it; listAllComplete({ includeBody: true }) and the CLI retry with --include-body return all bodies. The recovery builder lives in src/sdk/query/complete-list.ts. The emitted retry also uses the redundant legacy --no-truncate alias, which adds a migration hint. Expected: a declared projection requirement such as includeBody survives the recovery, or the certifier says explicitly that it cannot know and offers an opt-in recipe; page-incomplete refusal and the corpus safety invariants stay unchanged. Duplicate check: searched complete list recovery include body certify; pm-y4aaol (closed) shipped the primitive and pm-gh1078 (closed) fixed a stale recovery command name."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[5]: complete-list,"gh:1728",read-output,recovery,sdk
created_at: "2026-11-14T15:21:19.875Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-14T19:16:44.700Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-14T19:16:43.425Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-14T19:16:43.425Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "The CLI and SDK recovery for a refused complete list preserve an explicit includeBody request and use canonical flags; Specs cover a caller requesting bodies, one not requesting them, and empty bodies, executing the emitted recovery against the same fixture and comparing bodies, typed edges, learnings and counts; Page-incomplete refusal and the corpus safety invariants are unchanged"
parent: pm-usfg
risk: low
confidence: high
reporter: unbraind
severity: medium
resolution: "PmCompleteListValidationError (src/sdk/query/complete-list.ts) takes PmCompleteListOptions; certifyCompleteListResult and assertCompleteListResult take an optional options argument and otherwise read the candidate's filters.include_body record; listAllComplete passes its options. The recovery adds --include-body and listAllComplete({ includeBody: true }). --no-truncate stays: certification requires the filters.no_truncate only that flag echoes (an executed retry without it is refused page_incomplete); the hint mismatch is pm-qsdlwd."
expected_result: "Executing the emitted CLI or SDK recovery returns the bodies the refused request asked for, and none when it did not"
actual_result: "sdk-complete-list.integration.spec executes the emitted retry for includeBody true/false/omitted against a fixture with bodies, an empty body, a parent edge and a learning, and certifies the same summary as listAllComplete; complete-list.spec covers envelope, declared and absent requests; linked run passed 40/40"
